{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56758","headline":"任昇之五代祖仕梁於钟山悬岸圮圹中得古铭 · 不详","name":"任昇之五代祖仕梁於钟山悬岸圮圹中得古铭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龟言土，蓍言水，甸服黄钟啓灵趾。\n瘗在三上庚，堕遇七中巳。\n六千三百浃辰交，二九重三四百圮。\n（见《太平广记》卷三九一引李吉甫《梁大同古铭记》）（按：《全唐诗》卷八七五收《京西市放生池墓铭》，与此首二句同，「土」作「市」。\n李吉甫书名，从程毅中《古小说简目》说。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56758.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56758","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}